OL,3,GNEWSAYoung trader scoops national award
OL,4,Afor hot sauce
OL,5,
OL,6,FA chilli-loving young entrepreneur who
OL,7,Fgrew up "putting hot sauce on
OL,8,Feverything" has won a national award
OL,9,Ffor the spicy business he founded with
OL,10,Fhis brother.
OL,12,FAlex and Tom Ward from Rawmarsh,
OL,13,FRotherham, began experimenting making
OL,14,Ftheir own hot sauces in their parents'
OL,15,Fkitchen after spending six months
OL,16,Ftravelling the world and researching
OL,17,FSoutheast Asian cuisine.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
