OL,3,GNEWSAYoung trader scoops national award
OL,4,Afor hot sauce
OL,5,
OL,6,FA year after winning a regional award,
OL,7,FAlex, 28, has been awarded the title of
OL,8,FYoung Trader of the Year at the
OL,9,FNational Market Traders Federation
OL,10,F(NMTF).
OL,12,FDespite some "tough opposition" in the
OL,13,Fcategory, Alex admitted he "really
OL,14,Fwanted to win" and was delighted with
OL,15,Fthe result.
